# The shelf lists every puzzle with its progress, a page at a time.
expect Crossword
expect Odds and ends
expect Word square · 3×3 · 0/9 squares
expect-missing Help
clean
shot crossword-shelf
expect 1 of
tap-id puzzles-next
expect Midi 1
expect Mini 3
expect 2 of
expect-missing Odds and ends
clean
shot crossword-shelf-page-2
# Rules opened from the shelf runs to two pages and comes back to the
# shelf page it was opened on.
tap Rules
expect Fill the white squares
tap-id rules-next
expect tap Retry saving
expect-missing Retry saving in More
clean
shot crossword-rules-shelf-page-2
tap-id 4294967295
expect Midi 1
expect 2 of
expect-missing Fill the white squares
tap-id puzzles-previous
expect Odds and ends
# The first puzzle: its clue above the grid, every clue under it.
tap-id puzzle-3
expect 1 Across: Place down
expect Fingers on two hands (3)
expect Colour of a stop light (3)
expect Undo
expect-missing How to play
tap-id game-undo
expect Nothing to undo yet.
clean
shot crossword-play
# Two letters are neither one letter nor the whole word, so Enter refuses them.
tap-id cell-1
expect Letter or whole word
type pu
tap Enter
expect Enter one letter or the whole word.
clean
shot crossword-entry-refused
# Back drops the typed text and nothing reaches the grid.
tap-id 4294967295
expect 1 Across: Place down
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Crossword · 5×5 · 0/21 squares
tap-id puzzle-3
# One letter at a time walks along the word.
tap-id cell-1
type p
tap Enter
expect Letter or whole word
type u
tap Enter
type t
tap Enter
# A fourth letter does not fit a three letter word, and a digit is no letter.
type putt
expect Use Delete to change the answer.
tap Delete character
type 1
expect Use letters A–Z.
clean
shot crossword-entry-letters-only
tap-id 4294967295
# Across and Down turn the shaded word.
tap-id direction
expect 3 Down: Small sign of it
tap-id direction
expect 1 Across: Place down
# The clue list opens an answer straight from its clue.
tap-id clues
expect Lesser of two (5)
expect Flies the plane (5)
clean
shot crossword-clues
tap Grid
expect 1 Across: Place down
tap-id clues
tap Lesser of two
expect 4 Across
expect Lesser of two
# The next answer opens on the letters, not the symbol page the digit
# above left open.
expect ?123
expect-missing abc
clean
shot crossword-entry
type minor
tap Enter
expect 4 Across: Lesser of two
# Check word reports a right word and does not change a wrong one.
tap-id game-more
expect New game
expect Check word
expect Reveal square
expect Clear square
expect Restart puzzle
expect Puzzles
clean
shot crossword-more
tap Check word
expect This word is correct.
tap Back to puzzle
tap-id cell-10
type alikx
tap Enter
expect 6 Across: Much the same
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect 1 incorrect, 0 empty. Your letters are unchanged.
clean
shot crossword-check-wrong
tap Back to puzzle
# Reveal asks first, Keep playing leaves the square alone, and Undo takes a reveal back.
tap-id cell-14
tap-id 4294967295
tap-id game-more
tap Reveal square
expect Reveal square?
expect Adds one reveal.
clean
shot crossword-reveal-confirm
tap Keep playing
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect 1 incorrect, 0 empty.
tap Back to puzzle
tap-id game-more
tap Reveal square
tap Reveal
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect This word is correct.
tap Back to puzzle
tap Undo
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect 1 incorrect, 0 empty.
tap Back to puzzle
# Clear square empties the selected square, and says so when it already is.
tap-id game-more
tap Clear square
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect 0 incorrect, 1 empty.
tap Back to puzzle
tap-id game-more
tap Clear square
expect This square is already empty.
# Restart asks first, clears the letters, and can be undone.
tap-id game-more
tap Restart puzzle
expect Restart puzzle?
expect Clear the letters.
tap Keep playing
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Crossword · 5×5 · 12/21 squares
tap-id puzzle-3
tap-id game-more
tap Restart puzzle
tap Restart
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Crossword · 5×5 · 0/21 squares
tap-id puzzle-3
tap Undo
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Crossword · 5×5 · 12/21 squares
tap-id puzzle-3
# New game opens the next puzzle nobody has started.
tap-id game-more
tap New game
expect Small beginnings
expect Pet that purrs
clean
shot crossword-new-game
# A failed save replaces the board until it is retried.
scenario storage-full
tap-id cell-0
type c
tap Enter
expect Progress is not saved
expect Retry saving
clean
shot crossword-save-refused
scenario normal
tap Retry saving
expect-missing Progress is not saved
expect Letter or whole word
tap-id 4294967295
# Each puzzle keeps its own letters, and the app reopens on the last one played.
restart
wait-for Small beginnings
expect Pet that purrs
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Word square · 3×3 · 1/9 squares
expect Crossword · 5×5 · 12/21 squares
clean
shot crossword-resumed-shelf
